@startuml
actor Lecturer
boundary ProposalManagementInterface
control ProposalController
control ProposalService
control NotificationService
database Database

== Proposal Management ==

Lecturer -> ProposalManagementInterface: Request list of project proposals
ProposalManagementInterface -> ProposalController: GET /api/proposals
ProposalController -> ProposalService: Retrieve project proposals
ProposalService -> Database: Fetch project proposals
Database --> ProposalService: Return project proposals
ProposalService --> ProposalController: Return project proposals
ProposalController --> ProposalManagementInterface: Return project proposals

Lecturer -> ProposalManagementInterface: View proposal details
ProposalManagementInterface -> ProposalController: GET /api/proposals/{proposalId}
ProposalController -> ProposalService: Fetch proposal details
ProposalService -> Database: Fetch proposal details
Database --> ProposalService: Return proposal details
ProposalService --> ProposalController: Return proposal details
ProposalController --> ProposalManagementInterface: Return proposal details

Lecturer -> ProposalManagementInterface: Approve or reject proposal
ProposalManagementInterface -> ProposalController: POST /api/proposals/{proposalId}/approve or reject
ProposalController -> ProposalService: Approve/Reject proposal
ProposalService -> Database: Update proposal status
Database --> ProposalService: Return update status

alt Approval successful
    ProposalService -> NotificationService: Notify student of approval
    NotificationService -> StudentEmail: Send approval notification
    NotificationService --> ProposalService: Return notification status
else Rejection
    ProposalService -> NotificationService: Notify student of rejection
    NotificationService -> StudentEmail: Send rejection notification
    NotificationService --> ProposalService: Return notification status
end

ProposalService --> ProposalController: Return approval/rejection status
ProposalController --> ProposalManagementInterface: Return proposal management status

@enduml
